Do not let importing Megatron flip torch_memory_saver into "torch" hook mode.

This is the same change slime applies in its own image; see
/root/slime/docker/patch/latest/megatron.patch inside slimerl/slime:latest,
which carries this exact hunk (among 20 others we do not need).

Why we need it. `torch_memory_saver.hook_mode` is a process-global on a module
singleton, and the assignment below runs at *import* time. slime's launch
scripts put Megatron on PYTHONPATH inside the Ray runtime_env:

    "PYTHONPATH": "/root/Megatron-LM/:/workspace/examples/retool:/workspace"

so it is on the path for every actor, including the SGLang rollout engines. When
a scheduler subprocess imports sglang.srt.model_executor.model_runner it pulls in
megatron.core.inference.contexts.dynamic_context transitively, this line runs,
and TMS switches from its default "preload" mode to "torch". SGLang then reaches
CUDA graph capture and dies on:

    File ".../torch_memory_saver/entrypoint.py", line 158, in cuda_graph
        assert self._hook_mode == "preload", \
            "Only hook_mode=preload supports pauseable CUDA Graph currently"
    AssertionError: Only hook_mode=preload supports pauseable CUDA Graph currently

which surfaces as "Server process terminated unexpectedly" and an ActorDiedError
on RolloutManager.__init__.

It cannot be fixed from outside the file. Anything that sets hook_mode earlier
(a sitecustomize/.pth hook, an env var consumed at TMS import) loses, because
this assignment happens later and unconditionally overwrites it; and the process
that needs "preload" is the SGLang scheduler, which nobody gets to configure
between `import megatron` and the capture.

Setting HAVE_TORCH_MEMORY_SAVER = False rather than deleting the import keeps
the rest of dynamic_context.py on its already-supported no-TMS path -- the same
path taken when torch_memory_saver is not installed at all. Megatron's own
inference engine is not what slime runs; SGLang is.

Applies to Megatron-LM 3bec9aa97dda898d16ff5a89bac0ed2b6682b172 (core_v0.16.0),
the commit pinned in ../../sources.txt. Older pins do not need it: the
slime-rc0 Megatron (48406695c) has no torch_memory_saver reference at all.

diff --git a/megatron/core/inference/contexts/dynamic_context.py b/megatron/core/inference/contexts/dynamic_context.py
index 5dc2d5030..2b241c86d 100644
--- a/megatron/core/inference/contexts/dynamic_context.py
+++ b/megatron/core/inference/contexts/dynamic_context.py
@@ -61,8 +61,8 @@ except ImportError:
 try:
     from torch_memory_saver import torch_memory_saver
 
-    torch_memory_saver.hook_mode = "torch"
-    HAVE_TORCH_MEMORY_SAVER = True
+    # torch_memory_saver.hook_mode = "torch"
+    HAVE_TORCH_MEMORY_SAVER = False
 except ImportError:
     HAVE_TORCH_MEMORY_SAVER = False
 
